WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:02.681
Choosing antiseizure medication.

2
00:00:03.131 --> 00:00:07.159
Matching the first medicine to seizure type, comorbidities and life stage.

3
00:00:07.609 --> 00:00:12.625
Choose by seizure type, side-effect profile, interactions and plans for pregnancy.

4
00:00:13.075 --> 00:00:18.729
Discuss driving, bathing, heights and sudden unexpected death in epilepsy in a supportive way.

5
00:00:19.179 --> 00:00:23.579
Failure of two appropriate medicines should prompt referral to a specialist centre.
